# Plan Mode Workflow

When a TODO list is created in plan mode:

1. Work on only one TODO step at a time.
2. After finishing a step, stop and wait for explicit user approval.
3. Do not continue to the next step automatically.
4. Ask: "Ready to move on to the next step?"

This keeps execution reviewable and allows course-corrections between steps.
